'''Azmin''' is a [[Geno]]nian state-owned aerospace and defense company. 

==Products==
===Jet aircraft===
*[[Azmin CL-200]] passenger jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:BAC One-Eleven|BAC One-Eleven]])
*[[Azmin CL-300]] passenger jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:Dassault Mercure|Dassault Mercure]])
*[[Azmin CL-400]] passenger jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:McDonnell Douglas DC-10|McDonnell Douglas DC-10]])
*[[Azmin GF-7]] interceptor jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:Shenyang J-8|Shenyang J-8]])
*[[Azmin GF-11]] lightweight multirole fighter jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:Chengdu J-10|Chengdu J-10]])
*[[Azmin GF-12]] lightweight fighter-bomber jet (similar to the [[wikipedia:CAC/PAC JF-17 Thunder|CAC/PAC JF-17 Thunder]])

===Turboprop aircraft===
*[[Azmin PT-85]] STOL aircraft (similar to the [[wikipedia:Bréguet 941|Bréguet 941]])
*[[Azmin PT-105]] long-range maritime patrol aircraft (similar to the [[wikipedia:Bréguet 1150 Atlantic|Bréguet 1150 Atlantic]])

===Helicopters===
*[[Azmin H-40]]

===Drones===
*[[Azmin Daily Meteor]]
*[[Azmin Green Swamp]]
*[[Azmin Midnight Sword]]
*[[Azmin Red Swamp]]
*[[Azmin Sacrificial Lamb]]

